    >
      APCA vs WCAG: black or white text?
    </h1>
    <div
      class="space-y-3 mb-8"
    >
      <p>
        Ask WCAG 2 and APCA whether black or white text goes on a mid-tone background, and they often give opposite answers. Here is the same button, twice.
      </p>
